 /**
- * @brief Status byte of the startup "GIP / DLT ready" acknowledgement.
- *
- * Sent by the gateway once its own configuration, shared-memory transports and
- * IPC link are up, before any @c DLTMessageReadRequest has been received.  VIP
- * treats it as the trigger to release its own logging and to propagate the
- * ready indication to HSM and DM.
- *
- * By architectural decision the startup indication is an ordinary
- * @c DLTMessageReadAck carrying the default status - VIP, HSM and DM handle it
