- * @note Only @c status[0] is carried to VIP.  The GIP-side message models
- *       @c status as @c uint8[2] while the VIP-side @c SDLTMessageReadAck
- *       models it as a scalar @c uint8, so @c status[1] must not be relied on.
+ * @brief DLTMessageReadAck status of the startup "DLT ready" ACK (default status)
  */
